# The aws mock's answers to its data source,
# aws.availability_zone(+state, -name, -index: int) (R-36): one row per
# zone, its index the zone's position among the names sorted, so a plan
# never reshuffles.

aws.availability_zone("available", "us-east-1a", 0)
aws.availability_zone("available", "us-east-1b", 1)
aws.availability_zone("available", "us-east-1c", 2)
